OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 MAR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Music Rediscovered -
OL,5,     Fseries 2
OL,6,     GDomenico Corri's luxury song book
OL,7,     Gpioneered an innovative way of
OL,8,     Gannotating, which allows us to
OL,9,     Gunderstand singing performances
OL,10,     Gfrom the 1780s. Brianna Robertson-
OL,11,     GKirkland explains.
OL,12,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,13,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,14,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,15,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,16,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,17,     Geverything in between.
